This product includes software developed at, and reference material derived
from, the following open source projects:

1. OpenFGA (https://github.com/openfga/openfga)
   License: Apache License 2.0
   Use: protocol semantics, error code names, and the conformance test matrix
        (assets/tests/consolidated_1_1_tests.yaml, assets/tests/abac_tests.yaml).
        The test data is downloaded at test time into a git-ignored cache and is
        not redistributed in this repository. MoonFGA contains an independent
        MoonBit implementation; no Go source code is copied.

2. openfga/language (https://github.com/openfga/language)
   License: Apache License 2.0
   Use: OpenFGA DSL grammar reference (OpenFGALexer.g4, OpenFGAParser.g4) and
        transformer regression fixtures from tests/data (downloaded at test
        time into a git-ignored cache, not redistributed). The MoonBit lexer and
        parser are independently written.

3. moonbit-community/yaml (https://github.com/moonbit-community/yaml.mbt)
   License: MIT
   Use: YAML parsing for the conformance runner and .fga.yaml test files.

4. moonbitlang/x (https://github.com/moonbitlang/x)
   License: Apache License 2.0
   Use: filesystem access in the command line interface.

The full Apache License 2.0 text is in the LICENSE file. The MIT license text
for moonbit-community/yaml is reproduced in its distributed package.

5. Unicode character data (https://www.unicode.org)
   License: Unicode License V3 (third_party/UNICODE-LICENSE.txt)
   Use: generated category, script and simple-fold tables via Go's public unicode
        APIs. Unicode 17.0.0; no Go implementation code copied.

6. IANA Time Zone Database (https://www.iana.org/time-zones)
   License: public domain
   Use: generated historical transitions and future-rule data from tzdb 2026f.
        No timezone implementation code copied. See docs/timezones.md.
